@startuml decision-response-classes
!pragma layout smetana
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam classAttributeIconSize 0
hide empty members

class DecisionResponse {
  +getResults(): List<DecisionResult>
  +getAnswers(): Map<String, DecisionAnswer>
  +getYesNo(name): YesNoAnswer
  +getChoice(name): ChoiceAnswer
  +getScore(name): ScoreAnswer
  +getAnswer(name, type): DecisionAnswer
  +isRefused(name): boolean
  +getMetadata(): DecisionResponseMetadata
}
class DecisionResult {
  +getName()
  +getOutput(): DecisionAnswer
}
class DecisionResponseMetadata {
  +getId()
  +getModel()
  +getUsage(): Usage
}
interface DecisionAnswer <<sealed>>
class YesNoAnswer {
  +getProbability(): double
  +isYes(): boolean
  +isYes(threshold): boolean
}
class ChoiceAnswer {
  +getValue()
  +getProbability(option): Double
  +getProbabilities(): Map<String, Double>
  +getRankedOptions(): List<String>
  +getConfidence(): Double
}
class ScoreAnswer {
  +getValue(): double
  +getProbabilities(): List<Double>
  +getNearestLevel(): int
  +getRoundedLevel(): int
  +getConfidence(): Double
}
class RefusalAnswer {
  +getReason()
}

DecisionResponse --> "*" DecisionResult : in prompt order
DecisionResponse --> DecisionResponseMetadata
DecisionResult --> DecisionAnswer
DecisionAnswer <|.. YesNoAnswer
DecisionAnswer <|.. ChoiceAnswer
DecisionAnswer <|.. ScoreAnswer
DecisionAnswer <|.. RefusalAnswer
note bottom of YesNoAnswer : answers a YesNoQuestion
note bottom of ChoiceAnswer : answers a ChoiceQuestion
note bottom of ScoreAnswer : answers a ScoreQuestion
note bottom of RefusalAnswer : any question the provider declined
@enduml
